:"sha256:7064ec8150511d0ece145a492968b476aa5abae3e1c7ef385852631918086bdd","download_count":1170,"created_at":"2026-10-03T09:05:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T09:05:34Z"}],"body":"<!-- cliproxyapi-linux-release-assets:start -->\n## Linux release assets\n\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_linux_<arch>.tar.gz` is the default Linux build. It supports dynamic library plugins and is built against a GLIBC 2.17 baseline.\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_linux_<arch>_no-plugin.tar.gz` is the portable Linux build for musl-based or older systems such as OpenWrt. It does not support dynamic library plugins.\n\n## FreeBSD release assets\n\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_freebsd_aarch64_no-plugin.tar.gz` is the FreeBSD arm64 build. It is built without CGO and does not support dynamic library plugins.\n\n<!-- cliproxyapi-linux-release-assets:end -->\n\n## Changelog\n\n- perf(claude): prefilter JSON payloads before diagnostic walks (5dbce4f3)\n- fix(antigravity): replace retired Claude 4.6 models with 5.5 (e3abd9ae)\n- fix(antigravity): align Claude 5.5 token limits with upstream catalog (c575291a)\n- fix(antigravity): use actual Claude 5.5 high model IDs (6b037f61)\n- fix(claude): map request timeout status to timeout_error (42d484f9)\n- fix(auth): snapshot auth before unlocking during registration and update (d4692663)\n- fix(devin): stream content early and defer thought stop for late signatures (ea8ffd5f)\n- fix(responses): complete reasoning summary stream lifecycle events (ed4d972e)\n- fix(codex): publish main usage before image tool usage in execute (a3b77566)\n- fix(claude): include web search sources in codex request when search tool is present (2c1dcc7c)\n- fix(codex): expand integer field normalization mappings for tools (d7914afd)\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/compare/v8.0.12...v8.0.13\n","reactions":{"total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}
